{"2714920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pastor's Lake: The Game", "steam_appid": 2714920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Pastor's Lake - immerse yourself in the atmosphere of a summer cottage village.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having inherited a house in the village, the hero finds himself in a quiet area, far from noisy cities, where you can have a good rest for your soul and heart, but, unfortunately, it is very abandoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist interface with only basic hints; everything else is discovered through personal experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daynight cycle, with random precipitation causing mushrooms to regrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Needs System that can be replenished by either taking odd jobs or living entirely by gathering, fishing, or gardening. Groceries can also be purchased at the local store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various vehicles, from an ATV available at the beginning of the game to cars acquired as the game progresses. All personal vehicles consume fuel, which must be refueled at gas stations. One special car requires an oil change and can also be used as a taxi.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission tasks for helping volunteers restore the local church and finding the town and its museum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to build a sauna in your yard, use it yourself, or rent it out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can choose something he likes:  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore forest and village</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714920/extras/2642c8fa6b606cdc1b0fb3dce27b3108.avif?t=1787852192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714920/extras_big/2642c8fa6b606cdc1b0fb3dce27b3108.avif?t=1787852192 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plough, sow and reap the harvest in the fields</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714920/extras/e32ba12b9e0af19b2ebe67c5365c79a9.poster.avif?t=1787852192\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714920/extras/e32ba12b9e0af19b2ebe67c5365c79a9.webm?t=1787852192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714920/extras/e32ba12b9e0af19b2ebe67c5365c79a9.mp4?t=1787852192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714920/extras/abb676a608a3e6fa7499fe56db760f44.poster.avif?t=1787852192\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714920/extras/abb676a608a3e6fa7499fe56db760f44.webm?t=1787852192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714920/extras/abb676a608a3e6fa7499fe56db760f44.mp4?t=1787852192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick, cook or sell mushrooms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714920/extras/170f629504e4a4e309d2