 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Early Access Roadmap</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Fishing with the option to sell or cook your catch</span></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Story-based quest about church restoration</span></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Sowing, harvesting, and selling wheat</span></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Transportation work - taxi, bus driver</span></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Leaderboards for game points, fish size, and crayfish catch</span></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Urban location (city Sosnovy Bor)</span></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Growing and harvesting tomatoes in the garden, maintaining a chicken coop</span></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">Harvesting and bottling honey from the hive into containers</span></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Hunting game with firearms and then selling the catch</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasks to restore everyday life in local villages, with an increasing number of NPCs as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting household items, food, and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization of country house decor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded quests for finding valuable items on the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansion of the urban location with the introduction of new quests for earning in-game currency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reworking the visual style of existing locations with an increase in Detailing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><stro